{
  "scope": "One-worker ordinary Core on the pinned MultiCarElevator source and CFG. The four- and five-floor variants change only FloorCount. Each timing is a fresh process. Manyan uses its native membership policy. For violations the metric is wall to a counterexample; the checkers can search different prefixes.",
