  "commands": [
    "dive check Elevator.tla --config CFG --workers 1 --fp 0 --seed 0 --compat dive --max-memory 8g --time-limit 90s --output json",
    "make manyan on the pinned checkout. manyan -workers 1 -seed 0 -fp 0 -config CFG Elevator.tla. For separate witness runs add -dumpTrace json WORD.json. The matched short trials use 180s and no per-process CPU affinity.",
    "Translate Manyan witnesses with scripts/perf/scale/elevator-peer-word.py. Extract Dive counterexample.trace; use unmodified main dive validate-trace on original source and CFG, then change ending.back_to to 0 and repeat.",
    "Kafka uses the fixed4.cfg recipe from 2026-11-21-kafka-liveness.json with six invariants and four temporal properties, --store exact --max-memory 4g --time-limit 180s."
  ],
